# Homepage slice: the three feature cards.
# page > header (logo, navigation), page > main > hero,
#   page > main > card-group > (card-1, card-2, card-3), page > footer.
# Expresses everything with existing concepts: make, properties, inside.
# No new syntax, no Multiplicity — three card entities written out by hand.

make page
page title "Company Name"

make header
header inside page

make logo
logo text "Company Name"
logo inside header

make navigation
navigation inside header

make main container
main inside page

make hero banner
hero text "Welcome to Our Site"
hero inside main

make card-group card-group
card-group inside main

make card-1 card
card-1 title "Fast"
card-1 text "Lightning-quick rendering with no wasted motion."
card-1 inside card-group

make card-2 card
card-2 title "Simple"
card-2 text "Describe what you want; the machine handles the rest."
card-2 inside card-group

make card-3 card
card-3 title "Reliable"
card-3 text "One semantic model, three proven targets."
card-3 inside card-group

make footer
footer text "© Company Name 2026"
footer inside page

say page title